# Дано: server + A + B (20 m) + C (300 m) on WP_Protocol; both bots walk a circle.
# The spawns are 3-6 m apart, so every pawn is relevant from its spawn and a teleport inside the 625 m exit prints no
# new "relevant": the state is read off the per-pawn distance/period lines (ACCEPT-1126-NETPACK). B's circle keeps it
# 30-50 m from A (period 2), C walks 300-308 m (period 10).
Ждать A 60 \[Net\] pawn \d+ \(player \d+\): (?:[1-4]\d) m, period 2 \(30 Hz\), delay 0\.(?:1\d|20) s
Ждать A 60 \[Net\] pawn \d+ \(player \d+\): (?:29\d|30\d) m, period 10 \(6 Hz\), delay 0\.(?:3[5-9]|4\d|50) s
# Snapshot bytes/s to A: 35 B x (30 + 6) = 1260 B/s (dev: 34 B x 60 = 2040 B/s for the same two bots), 1200-1500.
Ждать server 30 \[Server\] net rates.*player \d+: 1(?:[2-4]\d\d|500) B/s, pawns by band \[30 Hz 1, 15 Hz 0, 6 Hz 1, 3 Hz 0\]
Ждать A 30 fresh \[Net\] pawn \d+ \(player \d+\): (?:29\d|30\d) m, period 10
